OL,3,CKeeping cool in the heatwave: Why your
OL,4,Cfan might be making you hotter
OL,6,FAs people prepare for what could end
OL,7,Fup being the hottest August day on
OL,8,Frecord, how do experts say you can
OL,9,Fstay cool at home and what tricks
OL,10,Fcould actually be making your home
OL,11,Fhotter?
OL,13,FShould I rely on my fan in a heatwave?
OL,15,FMany people think electric fans are a
OL,16,Fgood way to cool down, but experts
OL,17,Fhave stressed that on its own, a fan
OL,18,Fdoes little to bring down the
OL,19,Ftemperature of the room.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
