OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786688289
OL,3,CKeeping cool in the heatwave: Why your
OL,4,Cfan might be making you hotter
OL,6,FInstead, fans improve circulation,
OL,7,Fmoving air around the room, and
OL,8,Falthough not actually any different,
OL,9,Fmoving air does feel colder than still
OL,10,Fair.
OL,12,FWhile this might provide temporary
OL,13,Frelief if sitting in front of a fan,
OL,14,Fif there is no one in the room to
OL,15,Fbenefit from the moving air, the motor
OL,16,Fof the fan is actually increasing the
OL,17,Froom's temperature as it generates
OL,18,Fheat.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
