OL,3,CKeeping cool in the heatwave: Why your
OL,4,Cfan might be making you hotter
OL,6,FIt's important in these cases to
OL,7,Fremember to switch off the fan when
OL,8,Fleaving the room.
OL,10,FYou can also consider positioning the
OL,11,Ffan by a window facing outwards to
OL,12,Fblow hot air out of the room instead.
OL,14,FPlacing a tray with ice and water in
OL,15,Ffront of the fan can also decrease the
OL,16,Ftemperature of the air being
OL,17,Fcirculated around the room.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
