OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786688289
OL,3,CKeeping cool in the heatwave: Why your
OL,4,Cfan might be making you hotter
OL,6,F2. Keep internal doors closed and
OL,7,Favoid creating extra heat
OL,9,FClosing doors to unused rooms can help
OL,10,Fprevent heat spreading throughout the
OL,11,Fhouse.
OL,13,FRooms that remain cooler, particularly
OL,14,Fthose on north-facing sides of
OL,15,Fbuildings, can effectively become
OL,16,F"cool rooms" during heatwaves.
OL,18,F3. Open windows at night and early in
OL,19,Fthe morning
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
