PN,31410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786688289
OL,3,CKeeping cool in the heatwave: Why your
OL,4,Cfan might be making you hotter
OL,6,FDuring periods of extreme heat,
OL,7,Fexperts advise to avoid using ovens
OL,8,Fwhere possible and opting instead for
OL,9,Fsalads, cold meals or outdoor cooking.
OL,11,FSwitching off electrical appliances
OL,12,Fcompletely, rather than leaving them
OL,13,Fon standby, can also make a difference.
OL,15,F5. Freeze a hot water bottle to keep
OL,16,Fcool during the night
OL,18,FReach for a hot water bottle and get
OL,19,Fit in the freezer now so its ready for
OL,20,Ftonight.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
