OL,3,CKeeping cool in the heatwave: Why your
OL,4,Cfan might be making you hotter
OL,6,FFreezing a hot water bottle is an
OL,7,Fexcellent way to chill your bed or
OL,8,Fcool down during a heatwave.
OL,10,FTo do this safely and effectively,
OL,11,Ffill the bottle only about three-
OL,12,Fquarters full to allow the water to
OL,13,Fexpand as it freezes, and wrap it in a
OL,14,Ftowel to prevent condensation.
OL,16,F6. Drink plenty of water
OL,18,FExperts also stress that staying
OL,19,Fhydrated is just as important as
OL,20,Fkeeping homes cool.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
