OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786688289
OL,3,CKeeping cool in the heatwave: Why your
OL,4,Cfan might be making you hotter
OL,6,FDrinking plenty of water throughout
OL,7,Fthe day, avoiding excess alcohol and
OL,8,Fchecking on vulnerable relatives or
OL,9,Fneighbours can help reduce the risks
OL,10,Fassociated with extreme heat.
OL,12,FOlder people, young children and those
OL,13,Fwith underlying health conditions are
OL,14,Fparticularly susceptible to heat-
OL,15,Frelated illness.
